From: Paul Eggert <eggert@cs.ucla.edu>
Subject: gnulib: put nodiscard at the start of C23 declarations

Backport the list and ordered-set header changes from gnulib commit
786bb6fb17d698eb175942606db8fb129e231474. Keep the C23 nodiscard
attribute on the affected declarations.

Origin: https://github.com/coreutils/gnulib/commit/786bb6fb17d698eb175942606db8fb129e231474

